"Shapers, or Worldshapers, shape elements as the System defines them."
"The usual elements are ground, sky, life, water and object."
"Some Shapers get a narrow curveball element, or general Shaping with no specialty."
"Shapers practice by floating liquids, such as tea dregs."
"Shaper subtypes are bad below C-rank and spike to tremendously good at A."
"Shaper subtype names are obvious, such as Sky Shaper and Shaper of Life."
"Shapers direct their elements with gestures; high-rank Shapers look like they are dancing."
"Light is among the elements Shapers can hold."
"Shaping is strongest a few inches from the chest; farther out it is sloppier and more tiring."
"Shaped elements stay connected and actively powered; leveling or new talents extend range."
